OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy and grey start
OL,6,Fto Thursday. Perhaps the odd brighter
OL,7,Fspell developing through the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Chilly with a brisk wind,
OL,9,Fespecially towards the coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry overnight with cloud
OL,12,Fcover breaking at times to allow for
OL,13,Fsome clear spells. Becoming cold with
OL,14,Fa frost developing by dawn.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FCloudy through Friday with
OL,17,Fsome brighter spells during the
OL,18,Fmorning. Rain arrives into the west
OL,19,Fthrough the afternoon. Cold overnight,
OL,20,Fbut staying dry in the east with a
OL,21,Ffrost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
